    "answer": "(1)$x=v_0t$，$y=\\frac12gt^2$，轨迹 $y=\\frac{gx^2}{2v_0^2}$；(2)$\\vec v=v_0\\hat i+gt\\hat j$，$a_\\tau=\\frac{g^2t}{\\sqrt{v_0^2+g^2t^2}}$，$a_n=\\frac{gv_0}{\\sqrt{v_0^2+g^2t^2}}$；(3)$\\rho=\\frac{(v_0^2+2gh)^{3/2}}{gv_0}$",
